  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Strengthening doctoral education for health in Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to sustainably strengthen doct. educ. in the health sciences in Tanzania by building capacity in HE and research through strength. systems for quality developm. of doctoral training, gender-balanced recruitment and retention policies, PhD supervision and mentoring, development of PhD courses available through digital teaching and learning, establishing communities of learning among PhD students and carry out research on health of marginalized population, NCDs and more.</narrative>
  </description>
